
@1 = ~Please wait a moment.~
@2 = ~Secure and bring the prisoner Marco in front of me.~
@3 = ~At once.~
@4 = ~Come on Marco, you're moving out.~
@5 = ~It's about time, this auberge is really not to my liking...~
@6 = ~Where do you think you are?~
@7 = ~... The service also needs to be improved...~
@8 = ~We'll see if your compatriots in Eauprofonde offer you a more suitable cell... While awaiting your execution...~
@9 = ~... Harassment, violence... I really wouldn't recommend you to my friends...~
@10 = ~The prisoner's fate has not yet been decided.~
@11 = ~Well, despite what Marco's humor might suggest, our prisoners are treated with respect.~
@12 = ~Indeed, even the most difficult... The documents are in order, our duty is done.~
@13 = ~So, everything's ready, let's go!~

